<!doctype lake><title>Diffusion Language Models</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="aHGY8" id="aHGY8"><span data-lake-id="u0823cddc" id="u0823cddc">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="u214bfb63" id="u214bfb63"> 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u023b1f1b" id="u023b1f1b"><strong><span data-lake-id="udabb0f2f" id="udabb0f2f">大语言模型通过最大似然估计优化模型分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22t9jeY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0062f9e5" id="u0062f9e5">，刻画真实但未知的语言分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qu0tO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u695374f6" id="u695374f6">，等价于最小化两者的 KL 散度</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc545375c" id="uc545375c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZJtrz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmax_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x)%5C%5C%3B%5C%5CLongleftrightarrow%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BKL%7D%5C%5Cleft(p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta(x)%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGenerative%20modeling%20principles%7D%7D%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u092e14b3"><li fid="ubbf37f1f" data-lake-id="uc957570b" id="uc957570b"><span data-lake-id="u7754302a" id="u7754302a">当前占主导地位的方法采用自回归建模，即通常所称的 next token 预测范式，来定义模型分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1c16c351" id="u1c16c351" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oXln8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cunderbrace%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(x)%3Dp_%5C%5Ctheta(x%5E1)%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D2%7D%5E%7BL%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(x%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx%5E%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BAutoregressive%20formulation%7D%7D%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1fafecce"><li fid="u8b7bf6d7" data-lake-id="uc596f109" id="uc596f109"><span data-lake-id="u68f09d72" id="u68f09d72">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gvrIG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3b5243fe" id="u3b5243fe">是长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gk2v3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e364ee7" id="u7e364ee7">的序列，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rtRoR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%5Ei%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb96b0a1" id="ucb96b0a1">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bLZi9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c07c376" id="u2c07c376">个 token。这一范式已被证明极为有效，并成为当前大语言模型的基础。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u28014efc" id="u28014efc" style="color: #DF2A3F">然而，尽管它得到广泛应用，一个根本性问题仍未得到解答：自回归范式是否是实现大语言模型核心能力——例如可扩展性、上下文学习和指令遵循的唯一路径</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5a8ed329" id="u5a8ed329"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf297f79" id="ubf297f79">作者认为，此前被忽视的关键认识在于：从根本上支撑大语言模型基本特性的，是生成式建模原则，而不是自回归形式</span></strong></p><ul list="u91629bdd"><li fid="u674ccba6" data-lake-id="ue6c47396" id="ue6c47396"><span data-lake-id="udcf22293" id="udcf22293">可扩展性源于 Transformer、模型与数据规模，以及生成式建模原则带来的费舍尔一致性之间的共同作用，并非自回归模型独有</span>。<span data-lake-id="u2395c6c4" id="u2395c6c4">扩散 Transformer 在视觉数据上的成功支持这一观点。在结构一致的语言任务上，指令遵循和上下文学习能力似乎是所有条件生成模型的内在属性，而非自回归模型独有的优势。自回归模型可被视为无损数据压缩器，具有足够表达能力的其他概率模型也能实现类似能力</span></li><li fid="u674ccba6" data-lake-id="udf5a4cc8" id="udf5a4cc8"><span data-lake-id="ubf2b5e12" id="ubf2b5e12">然而，大语言模型的某些固有限制，可以直接归因于其自回归性质。例如，从左到右的生成过程限制它们处理逆向推理任务的能力，这凸显当前模型在泛化能力方面的一种典型缺陷</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufbb5c122" id="ufbb5c122"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9cddd79" id="ua9cddd79">基于上述认识，提出 LLaDA，以探究大语言模型所展现的能力，能否从自回归模型之外的生成式建模原则中涌现，从而回答前述根本性问题</span></strong></p><ul list="ueccb8040"><li fid="ub2e65466" data-lake-id="u3f033c1c" id="u3f033c1c"><span data-lake-id="u6fd6507d" id="u6fd6507d">不同于传统自回归模型，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f422049" id="u8f422049" style="color: #5C0036">LLaDA 采用掩蔽扩散模型（Masked Diffusion Model，MDM），其中包含一个前向数据掩蔽过程，并通过训练掩蔽 token 预测器来近似对应的逆向过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u908c4b92" id="u908c4b92">。这一设计使 LLaDA 能够构建具有双向依赖关系的模型分布，并优化其对数似然的变分下界，从而为理解上述大语言模型的核心能力，提供一个具有理论依据且此前尚未探索的视角</span></li><li fid="ub2e65466" data-lake-id="uf891dcba" id="uf891dcba"><span data-lake-id="ubcdaf99e" id="ubcdaf99e">采用包括数据准备、预训练、监督微调和评估在内的标准流程，将 LLaDA 扩展至语言扩散模型此前未达到的 8B 参数规模</span></li><li fid="ub2e65466" data-lake-id="u8d57615a" id="u8d57615a"><span data-lake-id="u04475aa4" id="u04475aa4">具体而言，LLaDA 8B 在 2.3T token 上从零开始预训练，消耗 13 万 H800 GPU 小时，随后使用 450 万对样本进行监督微调</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="Kq4IF" id="Kq4IF"><span data-lake-id="u83f19278" id="u83f19278">📡 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐦𝐀𝐬𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub2bbd0e0" id="ub2bbd0e0"><strong><span data-lake-id="udc5b3e79" id="udc5b3e79">不同于自回归模型，LLaDA 通过一个前向过程和一个逆向过程来定义模型分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ulq9U%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a571ac9" id="u7a571ac9">。前向过程逐步、独立地掩蔽</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zOjdE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c979c16" id="u1c979c16">中的 token，直至在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vuDHR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufcdb497c" id="ufcdb497c">时整个序列完全被掩蔽。当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22f4g8d%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u85fe2655" id="u85fe2655">时，序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mdOB3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4bf4e970" id="u4bf4e970">处于部分掩蔽状态，每个 token 以概率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vovAl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u73de5840" id="u73de5840">被掩蔽，或以概率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bsJBP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221-t%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucb0ce394" id="ucb0ce394">保持未掩蔽状态。逆向过程则随着</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MXXHU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaa6e46ab" id="uaa6e46ab">从 1 变化至 0，通过迭代预测被掩蔽的 token 来恢复数据分布</span></strong></p><figure data-lake-id="u8da465f0" id="u8da465f0" class="lake-figure" style="width:876.2000732421875px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A876.2000732421875%2C%22height%22%3A348.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1364%2C%22originHeight%22%3A542%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua923dd56%22%7D" data-asset="assets/bca275136c63b68986a3b0df27105e44.png"></card></figure><p data-lake-id="u34d7180c" id="u34d7180c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u18926d75" id="u18926d75" style="color: #5C0036">LLaDA 的核心是一个掩蔽 token 预测器，即参数化模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22amIAd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uff00344b" id="uff00344b" style="color: #5C0036">。它以</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CinRP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u684fd63e" id="u684fd63e" style="color: #5C0036">为输入，同时预测所有被掩蔽的 token，其中掩码 token 记为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iVgzQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BM%7D%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u047e997d" id="u047e997d" style="color: #5C0036">。<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">训练时，仅在被掩蔽的 token 位置上计算交叉熵损失</span></strong></span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u28f787c7" id="u28f787c7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22a1pwy%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Ctriangleq-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2Cx_0%2Cx_t%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bt%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Bx_t%5Ei%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BM%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(x_0%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u226afeb4"><li fid="u2f664368" data-lake-id="uda7207b1" id="uda7207b1"><span data-lake-id="ude408a06" id="ude408a06">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hJh8C%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u90f63063" id="u90f63063">为训练样本，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pnuq7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uab98bc32" id="uab98bc32">从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WTk9p%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76b23635" id="u76b23635">上连续均匀采样，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iLA5f%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7c95d64" id="ua7c95d64">由前向过程采样，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fmkg7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubba8ba1f" id="ubba8ba1f">为序列长度。指示函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wYjuL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue42464eb" id="ue42464eb">使损失仅计入被掩蔽的 token </span></li><li fid="u2f664368" data-lake-id="u9749856b" id="u9749856b"><span data-lake-id="u016aa8cd" id="u016aa8cd">训练完成后，可以模拟由掩蔽 token 预测器参数化的逆向过程，并将该过程在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yFqcN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf74fe3fa" id="uf74fe3fa">时诱导的边缘分布定义为模型分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kuq3V%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9db95054" id="u9db95054">。已有研究证明，式（3）中的损失函数是模型分布负对数似然的上界，因此，它为生成式建模提供具有理论依据的优化目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1487b286" id="u1487b286" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BUfSi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(x_0)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u44aa1cf6"><li fid="u2c342b0e" data-lake-id="u70477181" id="u70477181"><span data-lake-id="ucc00ed7e" id="ucc00ed7e"><strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">LLaDA 使用在 0 到 1 之间随机变化的掩蔽比例，而 BERT 使用固定的掩蔽比例</span></strong>。这一细微差异具有重要影响，尤其是在大规模建模情形下：如式（4）所示，LLaDA 是一种具有理论依据的生成模型，具有像大语言模型一样自然进行上下文学习和指令遵循的潜力</span></li><li fid="u2c342b0e" data-lake-id="u91083c9e" id="u91083c9e"><span data-lake-id="u53b70094" id="u53b70094">生成式建模为扩大数据和模型规模提供依据，最大似然估计则为将离散扩散模型扩展至大规模语言建模奠定理论基础</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud49ea1e5" id="ud49ea1e5"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua28078e9" id="ua28078e9">LLaDA 使用 Transformer 作为掩蔽 token 预测器，并省去因果注意力掩码，使模型在预测时能够访问完整输入</span></strong></p><ul list="u6c726ac4"><li fid="u2863e786" data-lake-id="u488c9a5d" id="u488c9a5d"><span data-lake-id="ua6b8901d" id="ua6b8901d">训练两种不同规模的 LLaDA，参数量分别为 1B 和 8B。<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">论文中的双向掩码预测无法直接沿用自回归解码的 KV 缓存机制</span></strong>，因此为简化实现，使用标准多头注意力，而非分组查询注意力。注意力层因此具有更多参数，相应缩小前馈网络的维度，以保持相近的模型规模。由于采用针对训练数据适配的分词器，词表大小也有所不同</span></li><li fid="u2863e786" data-lake-id="u6f802693" id="u6f802693"><span data-lake-id="uc162903d" id="uc162903d">LLaDA 在包含 2.3T token 的数据集上进行预训练，数据处理流程与现有大语言模型高度一致，未引入任何特殊技术。数据来自在线语料，使用人工设计的规则和基于大语言模型的方法过滤低质量内容。除通用文本外，数据集还包含高质量的代码、数学和多语言数据。预训练采用固定的 4096 token 序列长度，总计算开销为 13 万 H800 GPU 小时，与相同模型规模和数据规模下的自回归模型相近</span></li><li fid="u2863e786" data-lake-id="u0407bc49" id="u0407bc49"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucdd69e42" id="ucdd69e42" style="color: #664900">对于训练序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CSnRk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucfa6a9e2" id="ucfa6a9e2" style="color: #664900">，随机采样</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22E54iW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubabfbf66" id="ubabfbf66" style="color: #664900">，以相同的概率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qYBs7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ee7facb" id="u9ee7facb" style="color: #664900">独立掩蔽每个 token，得到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22diCrP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc5ab747c" id="uc5ab747c" style="color: #664900">，通过蒙特卡洛估计式（3）进行随机梯度下降。遵循 Nie et al. 的方法，为增强变长序列处理能力，将 1% 的预训练数据设为随机长度，并从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22sew4n%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B1%2C4096%5D%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc8e9ba54" id="uc8e9ba54" style="color: #664900">范围内均匀采样</span></strong></li></ul><h2 id="supervised-fine-tuning-and-inference">🦉 Supervised Fine-Tuning and Inference</h2><p data-lake-id="u3b0e659c" id="u3b0e659c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2130adba" id="u2130adba">用成对数据</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TWYur%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(p_0%2Cr_0)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua22e8697" id="ua22e8697">监督微调 LLaDA，以增强指令遵循能力；</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bucse%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u07058e94" id="u07058e94">为提示，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KbXpM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e92238e" id="u3e92238e">为响应，建模条件分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22scxpt%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(r_0%5C%5Cmid%20p_0)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb51d8db" id="ueb51d8db">，而非预训练的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SozUL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3ca9c115"><li fid="ub6c92475" data-lake-id="u2cd7d411" id="u2cd7d411"><span data-lake-id="ua5462f4b" id="ua5462f4b">类似预训练：保持提示，像处理</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kb0Tk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u20178dee" id="u20178dee">一样独立掩蔽响应 token。将提示与掩蔽响应</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KLsaQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1264db8a" id="u1264db8a">输入预训练的掩蔽 token 预测器，计算 SFT 损失</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufc81227e" id="ufc81227e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22M3RS7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2Cp_0%2Cr_0%2Cr_t%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bt%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Br_t%5Ei%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BM%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(r_0%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20p_0%2Cr_t%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u67b5e689"><li fid="u9c77a37c" data-lake-id="ud94868bc" id="ud94868bc"><span data-lake-id="ubcd4d15f" id="ubcd4d15f">该方法与预训练完全兼容。本质上，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gcy3J%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8366bfef" id="u8366bfef">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22U651R%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6c17467" id="ud6c17467">的拼接可以视为未掩蔽的预训练数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LRIC6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua468591b" id="ua468591b">，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gqGWg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb31b4e2" id="ucb31b4e2">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22sXDs3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04ea4725" id="u04ea4725">的拼接则对应掩蔽后的版本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22o1Cye%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u51a52689" id="u51a52689">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc976608f" id="uc976608f" style="color: #270070">这一过程与预训练相同，唯一的区别是所有被掩蔽的 token 都位于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MFPHE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u75ce6603" id="u75ce6603" style="color: #270070">部分</span></strong></li><li fid="u9c77a37c" data-lake-id="ud9dce8a7" id="ud9dce8a7"><span data-lake-id="u2ba0e3b1" id="u2ba0e3b1">LLaDA 8B 使用 450 万对样本进行 SFT，沿用现有大语言模型的数据准备与训练流程，未引入额外的专用优化。数据覆盖代码、数学和指令遵循等领域。对每个小批量中较短的样本对，在末尾追加</span><code data-lake-id="u2f61b7b4" id="u2f61b7b4"><span data-lake-id="u6999f286" id="u6999f286">|EOS|</span></code><span data-lake-id="u9c7e6dd7" id="u9c7e6dd7"> token，以确保所有样本长度一致。训练时，将</span><code data-lake-id="uce68a9fa" id="uce68a9fa"><span data-lake-id="u2f28c972" id="u2f28c972">|EOS|</span></code><span data-lake-id="u9a64bded" id="u9a64bded">视为普通 token；采样时则将其移除，从而使 LLaDA 能够自动控制响应长度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u374c78b0" id="u374c78b0"><strong><span data-lake-id="uae6190d8" id="uae6190d8">作为生成模型，LLaDA 能够以扩散方式采样生成新文本，并评估候选文本的似然，而不是采用从左到右的自回归方式</span></strong></p><ul list="ua6cf0b16"><li fid="u041063c1" data-lake-id="ufc64c549" id="ufc64c549"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf792627a" id="uf792627a">逆向生成过程：给定提示</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Nlg8U%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub73ce9f4" id="ub73ce9f4">，从一个完全被掩蔽的响应开始，通过离散化逆向过程，从模型分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22S8ANP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(r_0%5C%5Cmid%20p_0)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3bc0c5b2" id="u3bc0c5b2">中采样。总采样步数是一个超参数，这使 LLaDA 能够自然地在效率与样本质量之间进行权衡。默认情况下，采用均匀间隔的时间步。此外，<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">生成长度也被视为一个超参数</span></strong>，用于指定采样过程开始时完全被掩蔽的序列长度。生成完成后，丢弃</span></strong><code data-lake-id="uab62d64f" id="uab62d64f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua7916021" id="ua7916021">|EOS|</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id="u65cadb8a" id="u65cadb8a"> token 之后的所有 token </span></strong></li></ul><ul list="ua6cf0b16" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u041063c1" data-lake-id="u261478df" id="u261478df"><span data-lake-id="ubab1deff" id="ubab1deff">在从时间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IDOAd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29f0fda7" id="u29f0fda7">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nDsij%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s%5C%5Cin%5B0%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u00b09b5a" id="u00b09b5a">的一个中间步骤中，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IkBqq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e30ac81" id="u5e30ac81">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qjE1H%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94d954c7" id="u94d954c7">一并输入掩蔽 token 预测器，同时预测所有被掩蔽的 token。随后，在期望意义上，将这些预测 token 中比例为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wvbUH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bs%7D%7Bt%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucbb61c30" id="ucbb61c30">的部分重新掩蔽，得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zJgbk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97d13d4d" id="u97d13d4d">，其重新掩蔽概率对应前向过程所诱导的逆向转移</span></li><li fid="u041063c1" data-lake-id="u2d7ce818" id="u2d7ce818"><span data-lake-id="u969bd68b" id="u969bd68b">原则上，重新掩蔽策略应当完全随机。然而，受大语言模型采样中退火技巧的启发，采用低置信度重新掩蔽策略：根据模型预测，将预测 token 中置信度最低、占比为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HQicj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bs%7D%7Bt%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3ce46a4b" id="u3ce46a4b">的部分重新掩蔽</span></li></ul><ul list="ua6cf0b16" start="2"><li fid="u041063c1" data-lake-id="u71ed9e27" id="u71ed9e27"><span data-lake-id="u1c8e732a" id="u1c8e732a">LLaDA 支持灵活的采样方式。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u16cda6c5" id="u16cda6c5" style="color: #270070">具体而言，在完成上述预训练或 SFT 后，它可以直接支持自回归采样和块扩散采样，无需任何进一步的修改或训练。不过，扩散采样，即逆向生成过程，能够获得最佳性能，因此被作为本文的默认采样方式</span></strong></li><li fid="u041063c1" data-lake-id="uc7756ede" id="uc7756ede"><span data-lake-id="u8146400f" id="u8146400f">对于条件似然评估，式（5）中的上界可等价地写为下述方差更低、更加稳定的形式</span><span data-lake-id="uad4cf4b3" id="uad4cf4b3">，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Woldx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee52f6f0" id="uee52f6f0">为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PpuKz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5cf10b30" id="u5cf10b30">的序列长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cZfws%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22l%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue39a9096" id="ue39a9096">从集合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OK5zW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B1%2C2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CL%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u31d45e39" id="u31d45e39">中均匀采样，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Btvyf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_l%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u548dcda7" id="u548dcda7">则通过从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vdRGL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud117b670" id="ud117b670">中均匀、无放回地采样</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lm5s0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22l%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub13559f9" id="ub13559f9">个 token 并将其掩蔽而得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u17490968" id="u17490968" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mRPPU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bl%2Cr_0%2Cr_l%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7BL%7D%7Bl%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Br_l%5Ei%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BM%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(r_0%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20p_0%2Cr_l%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%7D"></card></p><!-- Transcribed from the user-supplied NeurIPS 2025 paper, pp. 25–27, Algorithms 1–5.
Algorithm 5 corrects the paper's Lowest-n_un typo and selects positions only from
the currently masked set, consistent with ML-GSAI/LLaDA generate.py.
The paper's floor schedule is retained; this is not a literal code transcription. --><h2 id="training-and-evaluation-algorithms">🧮 Training and Evaluation Algorithms</h2><p id="diffusion-fa39ce-1"><strong>预训练与监督微调均通过随机掩码构造预测任务，区别在于<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">监督微调始终保留提示，仅对响应施加掩码</span></strong></strong></p><ul><li id="diffusion-fa39ce-2"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%200%7D%22%7D"></card>表示前文的独立掩码过程，每个位置以概率<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card>变为<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%20M%22%7D"></card>，以概率<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221-t%22%7D"></card>保留原 token</li><li id="diffusion-fa39ce-3">算法 1 与算法 2 分别按输入长度<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card>和响应长度<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L'%22%7D"></card>对损失归一化；预训练中有 1% 的样本使用从<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C4096%22%7D"></card>均匀采样的序列长度</li></ul><figure class="paper-algorithm" id="llada-algorithm-1-figure" aria-labelledby="llada-algorithm-1"><figcaption id="llada-algorithm-1"><strong>Algorithm 1</strong> Pre-training of LLaDA</figcaption><div class="algorithm-body" id="llada-algorithms-25"><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number"></span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-25-line-0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7BRequire%3A%7D%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bmask%20predictor%20%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%20distribution%20%7Dp_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">1</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-25-line-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Brepeat%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">2</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-25-line-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%20x_0%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">3</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-25-line-3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Csim%20U(0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">4</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-25-line-4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%20x_t%5C%5Csim%20q_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%200%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">5</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-25-line-5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Cmathcal%20L%5C%5Cgets-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BtL%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%201%5Bx_t%5Ei%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%20M%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">6</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-25-line-6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BCalculate%20%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathcal%20L%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20run%20optimizer%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">7</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-25-line-7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Buntil%20%7D%5C%5Ctext%7Bconverged%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">8</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-25-line-8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Breturn%20%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card></span></div></div></figure><figure class="paper-algorithm" id="llada-algorithm-2-figure" aria-labelledby="llada-algorithm-2"><figcaption id="llada-algorithm-2"><strong>Algorithm 2</strong> Supervised Fine-Tuning of LLaDA</figcaption><div class="algorithm-body" id="llada-algorithms-26"><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number"></span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-26-line-0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7BRequire%3A%7D%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bmask%20predictor%20%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bpair%20data%20distribution%20%7Dp_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">1</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-26-line-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Brepeat%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">2</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-26-line-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad(p_0%2Cr_0)%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">3</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-26-line-3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Csim%20U(0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">4</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-26-line-4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%20r_t%5C%5Csim%20q_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%200%7D(r_t%5C%5Cmid%20r_0)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">5</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-26-line-5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Cmathcal%20L%5C%5Cgets-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BtL'%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL'%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%201%5Br_t%5Ei%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%20M%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(r_0%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20p_0%2Cr_t)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">6</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-26-line-6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BCalculate%20%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathcal%20L%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20run%20optimizer%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">7</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-26-line-7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Buntil%20%7D%5C%5Ctext%7Bconverged%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">8</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-26-line-8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Breturn%20%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card></span></div></div></figure><p id="diffusion-fa39ce-4"><strong>条件似然评估通过重复掩码估计与式（6）对应的对数似然下界，并以此为候选响应评分</strong></p><ul><li id="diffusion-fa39ce-5">固定提示<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%7D"></card>与响应<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%7D"></card>，每次先均匀采样掩码数量<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-10%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22l%22%7D"></card>，再无放回地选择掩码位置；<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-11%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card>为响应长度，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-inline-12%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n_%7Bmc%7D%22%7D"></card>为蒙特卡洛估计次数</li></ul><figure class="paper-algorithm" id="llada-algorithm-3-figure" aria-labelledby="llada-algorithm-3"><figcaption id="llada-algorithm-3"><strong>Algorithm 3</strong> Conditional Log-likelihood Evaluation of LLaDA</figcaption><div class="algorithm-body" id="llada-algorithms-27"><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number"></span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-27-line-0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7BRequire%3A%7D%5C%5C%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bprompt%20%7Dp_0%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bresponse%20%7Dr_0%2C%5C%5C%20n_%7Bmc%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">1</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-27-line-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blog%5C%5C_likelihood%7D%5C%5Cgets%200%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">2</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-27-line-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Di%5C%5Cgets%201%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20to%20%7Dn_%7Bmc%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20do%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">3</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-27-line-3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%20l%5C%5Csim%5C%5Coperatorname%7BUniform%7D%5C%5C%7B1%2C2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CL%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">4</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-27-line-4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BObtain%20%7Dr_l%5C%5Ctext%7B%20by%20uniformly%20masking%20%7Dl%5C%5Ctext%7B%20positions%20of%20%7Dr_0%5C%5Ctext%7B%20without%20replacement%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">5</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-27-line-5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blog%5C%5C_likelihood%7D%5C%5Cgets%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blog%5C%5C_likelihood%7D%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7BL%7D%7Bl%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%201%5Br_l%5Ei%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%20M%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(r_0%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20p_0%2Cr_l)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">6</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-27-line-6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">7</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-27-line-7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blog%5C%5C_likelihood%7D%5C%5Cgets%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blog%5C%5C_likelihood%7D%2Fn_%7Bmc%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">8</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22llada-algorithms-27-line-8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Breturn%20%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blog%5C%5C_likelihood%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div></div></figure><h1 data-lake-id="KCgpZ" id="KCgpZ"><span data-lake-id="u4dac800f" id="u4dac800f">📡</span><span data-lake-id="u638952a4" id="u638952a4"> 𝐁𝐥𝐨𝐜𝐤 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧: 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐩𝐨𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐁𝐞𝐭𝐰𝐞𝐞𝐧 𝐀𝐮𝐭𝐨𝐫𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ud7a79070" id="ud7a79070"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8a7d3d69" id="u8a7d3d69">与自回归模型相比，扩散模型具有加速生成过程、提高模型输出可控性的潜力。目前，离散扩散模型至少面临三项局限</span></strong></p><ul list="u720a03bb"><li fid="u5b0f3ac1" data-lake-id="uc1fd650c" id="uc1fd650c"><span data-lake-id="ub9693fca" id="ub9693fca">首先，聊天系统需要根据用户问题生成不同长度的回答，而论文讨论的大多数扩散架构只能生成固定长度的向量</span></li><li fid="u5b0f3ac1" data-lake-id="u4037fa8a" id="u4037fa8a"><span data-lake-id="ue6d5a9fe" id="ue6d5a9fe">其次，离散扩散在生成过程中使用双向上下文，因此无法通过 KV 缓存复用此前的计算结果，导致推理效率较低</span></li><li fid="u5b0f3ac1" data-lake-id="u0d374939" id="u0d374939"><span data-lake-id="ufe4bc03c" id="ufe4bc03c">最后，以困惑度等标准指标衡量时，离散扩散模型的质量仍落后于自回归方法，进一步限制其适用性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc6eb82ef" id="uc6eb82ef"><strong><span data-lake-id="u93dd9129" id="u93dd9129">本文提出块离散去噪扩散语言模型，在解决上述局限方面取得进展。这类模型在离散扩散模型与自回归模型之间进行插值</span></strong></p><ul list="u56f4c21b"><li fid="u577fc169" data-lake-id="u1caa03b3" id="u1caa03b3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0e246575" id="u0e246575" style="color: #DF2A3F">块扩散模型亦称半自回归模型，在离散变量组成的块之间定义自回归分布；给定先前各块，当前块的条件分布由离散去噪扩散模型刻画</span></strong></li><li fid="u577fc169" data-lake-id="u76e61489" id="u76e61489"><span data-lake-id="u5be5f9a9" id="u5be5f9a9">构建有效的 BD3-LMs 面临两个挑战。首先，一次标准前向传播难以高效计算块扩散目标，因此需要专门的训练算法。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u06399fb5" id="u06399fb5" style="color: #5C0036">其次，扩散目标的梯度方差较高，阻碍模型训练，导致 BD3-LMs 即使在块大小为 1 时，表现仍不及自回归模型，而此时两类模型本应等价</span></strong></li><li fid="u577fc169" data-lake-id="u44f61d53" id="u44f61d53"><span data-lake-id="uc3f0ac02" id="uc3f0ac02">推导梯度方差的估计量，并表明，梯度方差是造成自回归模型与扩散模型之间困惑度差距的一个关键因素。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u68a0322f" id="u68a0322f" style="color: #5C0036">随后，提出专门设计的噪声过程，以最小化梯度方差，并在缩小这一困惑度差距方面取得进展</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2a945b0a" id="u2a945b0a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u24359153" id="u24359153">与在嵌入空间中执行高斯扩散的其他半自回归形式相比，BD3-LMs 支持可计算的似然估计，并且能够在生成步数减少一个数量级的情况下，生成具有更优生成困惑度的样本。综上，本文的主要贡献如下</span></strong></p><ul list="u4e0fead9"><li fid="u8e9d36d8" data-lake-id="ufb16250f" id="ufb16250f"><span data-lake-id="ud3fac22d" id="ud3fac22d">提出块离散扩散语言模型，在块间采用自回归建模，在块内采用离散扩散，并支持变长生成和 KV 缓存</span></li><li fid="u8e9d36d8" data-lake-id="ubddc7530" id="ubddc7530"><span data-lake-id="u03cebc29" id="u03cebc29">提出针对块扩散模型的专用训练算法，能够高效利用输入模型的整个批次中的全部 token。发现梯度方差是限制扩散模型性能的一个因素，并提出专门设计的数据驱动噪声调度，以降低梯度方差</span></li></ul><figure data-lake-id="u5ca54527" id="u5ca54527" class="lake-figure" style="width:790px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A900.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A360.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1223%2C%22originHeight%22%3A489%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud944e05d%22%7D" data-asset="assets/1facf666cf825efd49a04cbfb0fd12f2.png"></card></figure><h2 data-lake-id="TyLgL" id="TyLgL"><span data-lake-id="u9746441a" id="u9746441a">💻</span><span data-lake-id="ucda6a6b7" id="ucda6a6b7"> 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝: 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐝𝐢𝐠𝐦𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u247b17bc" id="u247b17bc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u97d54784" id="u97d54784">自回归模型：考虑从数据分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ml3k2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u09e971c9" id="u09e971c9">中抽取的、由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YrJM3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u93652c6a" id="u93652c6a">个 token 构成的序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TFlNe%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3D%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua69c655e" id="ua69c655e">。自回归模型定义如下形式的因子分解分布</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u394e13f5" id="u394e13f5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XXeRZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7B%5C%5Cell%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3C%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud72f9eae"><li fid="ud6b48ea3" data-lake-id="u44479f7f" id="u44479f7f"><span data-lake-id="ue085a717" id="ue085a717">其中，每个条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zMzqU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3C%5C%5Cell%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u23507d83" id="u23507d83">均由神经网络直接参数化。因此，自回归模型可以通过 next token 预测进行高效训练。然而，由于存在顺序依赖关系，自回归模型生成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hnhna%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd0fdc50" id="udd0fdc50">个 token 需要执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JsopZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u646c0c9f" id="u646c0c9f">个步骤</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u82fc47d1" id="u82fc47d1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u910946c2" id="u910946c2">离散去噪扩散概率模型：扩散模型通过拟合模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BcssL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7ffde509" id="u7ffde509">，来逆转前向扰动过程</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QmUuK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue24afa5b"><li fid="u0f6f0c9b" data-lake-id="u0480f50b" id="u0480f50b"><span data-lake-id="u95519cdb" id="u95519cdb">该过程从干净数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22D2A2p%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a195a90" id="u1a195a90">出发，对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wEVDU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua03abdbb" id="ua03abdbb">，定义潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CVFVe%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%3D%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7BL%7D%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5382dac7" id="u5382dac7">，表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22AZjpE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub269c0c8" id="ub269c0c8">的噪声程度逐渐增大的版本。将这一过程离散化为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qS2nm%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc2086988" id="uc2086988">个步骤后，定义</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vBJwY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s(j)%3D(j-1)%2FT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2efdd2e5" id="u2efdd2e5">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jzgEI%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t(j)%3Dj%2FT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc7c387a2" id="uc7c387a2"></span></li><li fid="u0f6f0c9b" data-lake-id="uc2331146" id="uc2331146"><span data-lake-id="u21c5d1e2" id="u21c5d1e2">D3PM 框架将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iXaYj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud83c2f22" id="ud83c2f22">定义为独立作用于每个 token </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22I5Nwh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u305967af" id="u305967af">的马尔可夫前向过程，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CTSjC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCat%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%20s%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua62135fe" id="ua62135fe">，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Nmz3s%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%20s%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BV%5C%5Ctimes%20V%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a1c2c7c" id="u7a1c2c7c">为扩散矩阵。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SH1iV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%20s%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue88f27c1" id="ue88f27c1">可刻画掩蔽、随机 token 替换和相关词语替换。理想的扩散模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GbMmW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e0b72cd" id="u7e0b72cd">是过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wghLM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9558bfc2" id="u9558bfc2">的逆过程。D3PM 框架将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Clay6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb35fcb5" id="ucb35fcb5">定义为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uadbd06ef" id="uadbd06ef" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QtKv2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7B%5C%5Cell%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cprod_%7B%5C%5Cell%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7Dq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cright)p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3528dd9b"><li fid="u9a6e4f27" data-lake-id="u72c227d5" id="u72c227d5"><span data-lake-id="u03f9a3a5" id="u03f9a3a5">其中，基础去噪模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22y8rZO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3b8ec78" id="ue3b8ec78">在给定含噪序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dTwma%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f9a7ba5" id="u6f9a7ba5">的条件下，预测干净 token </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TDWFm%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%22%7D"></card><span fid="u9a6e4f27" data-lake-id="u106413ca" id="u106413ca"><span data-lake-id="u1ce2e138" id="u1ce2e138">。扩散模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JK7E3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6086e78" id="ue6086e78">通过变分推断进行训练。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22w1gge%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BKL%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua77cd6be" id="ua77cd6be">表示 Kullback–Leibler 散度，则负证据下界为</span></span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u64e493c0" id="u64e493c0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zTRB7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta%29%3D-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%281%29%7D%29%2BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C%21%5C%5Cleft%5Bq%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%28T%29%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%29%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%28T%29%7D%29%5C%5Cright%5D%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7DD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C%21%5C%5Cleft%5Bq%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%28j%29%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%28j%29%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%29%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%28j%29%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%28j%29%7D%29%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="P4FT5" id="P4FT5"><span data-lake-id="u11947bd5" id="u11947bd5">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="u6c2244fc" id="u6c2244fc"> 𝐁𝐥𝐨𝐜𝐤 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u590251c5" id="u590251c5"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub30d97fe" id="ub30d97fe">块离散去噪扩散语言模型在块间定义自回归分布、在块内执行扩散，从而在自回归与扩散两种建模方式之间进行插值</span></strong>。<span data-lake-id="ue0ca86ca" id="ue0ca86ca">提出用于最大似然估计的块扩散目标，以及高效的训练和采样算法。表明，当块大小为 1 时，尽管扩散目标在期望意义上等价于自回归似然，但其方差仍然较高。将较高的训练方差识别为扩散模型的一项局限，并提出数据驱动的噪声调度，以降低训练过程中梯度更新的方差</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2768438f" id="u2768438f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6da6212b" id="u6da6212b">块扩散分布与模型架构：在 token 块之间进行自回归建模，并在每个块内部执行扩散</span></strong></p><ul list="u125ab586"><li fid="u043af8e5" data-lake-id="u123f6dc1" id="u123f6dc1"><span data-lake-id="ucba901af" id="ucba901af">将序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KSQbc%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub269d4aa" id="ub269d4aa">中的 token 划分为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bgzMg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02c88a20" id="u02c88a20">个长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SnQrD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u094f02ea" id="u094f02ea">的块，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22p0pTb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22B%3DL%2FL%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u647ead4a" id="u647ead4a">，并假设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22AtBBQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucab08cf3" id="ucab08cf3">为整数。对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RxYk1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CB%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc35b154d" id="uc35b154d">，将位置从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xeUPi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(b-1)L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%2B1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1edaa2d0" id="u1edaa2d0">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IwHq1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22bL%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3bcecb4" id="ue3bcecb4">的 token 块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dYHmc%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(b-1)L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%2B1%3AbL%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd9e92f9" id="ubd9e92f9">记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pptTG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u15f0d0e3" id="u15f0d0e3">。模型的对数似然按块分解为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u40bf9902" id="u40bf9902" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FHyZW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud84bd533"><li fid="u1e69d900" data-lake-id="u44e60820" id="u44e60820"><span data-lake-id="u4a2bc006" id="u4a2bc006">每个条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FWaPL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub652dded" id="ub652dded">均通过在包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xE28O%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41cd3794" id="u41cd3794">个 token 的块上执行离散扩散来建模。类似式（2），定义第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BREyq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fd93cca" id="u8fd93cca">个块的逆向扩散过程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua25ce0d0" id="ua25ce0d0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JyfSw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%7Dq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u80bcc3d8"><li fid="ue2b16f82" data-lake-id="ube02b8f6" id="ube02b8f6"><span data-lake-id="u9ad97879" id="u9ad97879">将式（3）中的负证据下界（NELBO）分别应用于式（4）的各项，即可得到一个具有理论依据的学习目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u36a9b433" id="u36a9b433" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nCsOM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3A%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="udf56b28d"><li fid="u02f9ba2f" data-lake-id="u4db07771" id="u4db07771"><span data-lake-id="u4e70cc80" id="u4e70cc80">其中，每个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DJZkn%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77243ce0" id="u77243ce0">都是将式（3）应用于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22D7F2R%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4806583d" id="u4806583d">所得到的实例。由于模型以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DlKEL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u079da78b" id="u079da78b">为条件，在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dWvkh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9ef98f90" id="u9ef98f90">中显式标明其对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22q8tAh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucc2bc332" id="ucc2bc332">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KlSds%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u147727c2" id="u147727c2">的依赖。将这些项的总和记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Yxcsa%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue2ae7d45" id="ue2ae7d45">，它本身也是一个有效的负证据下界</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u367f187c" id="u367f187c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u817b6120" id="u817b6120">模型架构：使用单个神经网络</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qmJrT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc36f9fc" id="ucc36f9fc">，对这</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jLdEU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22B%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c8fff2f" id="u6c8fff2f">个基础去噪模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NTbVC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud5110526" id="ud5110526">进行参数化。神经网络</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22r1w1A%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6637f776" id="u6637f776">不仅输出概率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zYXJz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f2ca860" id="u8f2ca860">，还输出用于高效训练的中间计算结果。这使能够以节省内存的方式，并行计算全部</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Zmi3j%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22B%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u129db491" id="u129db491">个块的损失</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mfKnv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4602f423"><li fid="ub04942ee" data-lake-id="ufbf2a905" id="ufbf2a905"><span data-lake-id="uce075912" id="uce075912">使用带有块因果注意力掩码的 Transformer 来参数化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kbqFG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64a6fe82" id="u64a6fe82">。该 Transformer 处理</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kIWnD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u388d5b1f" id="u388d5b1f">个 token，其中，第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Nr2pC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1cb21e79" id="u1cb21e79">个块中的 token 可以关注第 1 至第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VtBCq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua308670a" id="ua308670a">个块中的 token。训练得到的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22U3DQi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u20bed547" id="u20bed547">根据含噪块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22AGYOA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u01b10322" id="u01b10322">和干净的历史块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UZuT2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uab8c10de" id="uab8c10de">，输出第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JeeSw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d30df96" id="u4d30df96">个块中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ovfBc%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d76dda8" id="u1d76dda8">个 token 的去噪预测</span></li><li fid="ub04942ee" data-lake-id="u2b887485" id="u2b887485"><span data-lake-id="ue19ee9a5" id="ue19ee9a5">在自回归生成中，通常会缓存此前已生成 token 的键和值，以避免每一步都重新计算。类似地，用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hyi3H%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueed6e7c4" id="ueed6e7c4">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YUtkG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97530ec9" id="u97530ec9">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22sm66E%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3ed3521" id="ud3ed3521">个块的键和值，并使</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mLXuk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaaf3be3a" id="uaaf3be3a">支持将它们作为输入和输出。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LT2T9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57b72806" id="u57b72806">的完整输入输出接口为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue52df0aa" id="ue52df0aa" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Tsgsx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogits%7D%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u99beeba4"><li fid="u3d440fb5" data-lake-id="u0aa909fe" id="u0aa909fe"><span data-lake-id="ud2a8bf21" id="ud2a8bf21">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dCf3q%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogits%7D%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc7c11f3b" id="uc7c11f3b">是对干净块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hWMyd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd3009ff" id="ubd3009ff">的预测，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KW2cb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3d562ffd" id="u3d562ffd">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22U671O%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf884931c" id="uf884931c">是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22u8WhA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue31f8bd6" id="ue31f8bd6">前向传播过程中产生的键值缓存；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kpHyC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubab7329c" id="ubab7329c">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zEKoi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u007428dd" id="u007428dd">则是在对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WkmKy%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffe29944" id="uffe29944">执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cgvub%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a1ff004" id="u1a1ff004">的前向传播时缓存的键和值。因此，以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22h48Rg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u426fc850" id="u426fc850">为输入，与以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HUGfB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e2d3a7b" id="u5e2d3a7b">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TWLxt%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e54e897" id="u1e54e897">为输入是等价的</span></li></ul><!-- Transcribed from the supplied Block Diffusion paper, Algorithms 1–2.
Keep the paper's notation and update order; line numbers are presentation only. --><h2 id="training-and-sampling-algorithms">🧮 Training and Sampling Algorithms</h2><p data-lake-id="u9b302d83" id="u9b302d83"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0dba0a9f" id="u0dba0a9f">高效训练与采样算法：理想情况下，希望仅通过</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22O2dir%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u35b58474" id="u35b58474">的一次前向传播，就计算出损失</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oLMbT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u476ea095" id="u476ea095">。然而，对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22medlO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u46f57c8f" id="u46f57c8f">进行去噪，需要以这一含噪输入执行一次前向传播；而对后续块进行去噪，则需要在该块的干净版本</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oqLcU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf04e2a6" id="ubf04e2a6">上运行</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22sr86w%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb9f7c59" id="ueb9f7c59">。因此，<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">每个块都必须至少经过模型两次</span></strong></span></strong></p><ul list="ube24f1e9"><li fid="u82be4236" data-lake-id="u7e573209" id="u7e573209"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub26c4996" id="ub26c4996">训练：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uefa48a9d" id="uefa48a9d">基于这一观察，提出满足上述最低计算需求的训练算法。具体而言，首先对完整序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nsxz7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21b8507d" id="u21b8507d">执行一次前向传播，预先计算键和值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22W4YX5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3AB%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28b4ef41" id="u28b4ef41">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wfEA5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3AB%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u48e33634" id="u48e33634">，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ft1WB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cvarnothing%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3AB%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3AB%7D)%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub21ab7cc" id="ub21ab7cc">。随后，使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mIbsz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u33c00881" id="u33c00881">计算所有块的去噪预测。每个 token 经过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TVlsz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57c4d505" id="u57c4d505">两次</span></li><li fid="u82be4236" data-lake-id="u56854de0" id="u56854de0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u556cbedf" id="u556cbedf">向量化训练：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50f41b0c" id="u50f41b0c">一种朴素实现是循环</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MHBBQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a45c27d" id="u8a45c27d">次，分别调用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EXFyH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4460e116" id="u4460e116">来计算 logits。将含噪数据与干净数据拼接为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Na3fU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnoisy%7D%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a6022a4" id="u3a6022a4">，通过一次前向传播计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jUFIG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e741b62" id="u1e741b62">。其中，含噪数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22AWZkw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnoisy%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_1%7D%5E%7B1%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Ccdots%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_B%7D%5E%7BB%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u27461deb" id="u27461deb">由对每个块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MBzrD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f5d9fd4" id="u4f5d9fd4">分别施加噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22x3s6J%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d454c5e" id="u8d454c5e">得到。为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wzLoB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnoisy%7D%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc57850d5" id="uc57850d5">设计注意力掩码，<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">使含噪 token 能够关注同一块中的其他含噪 token，以及所有先前块中的干净 token </span></strong></span></li></ul><ul list="ube24f1e9"><li fid="u82be4236" data-lake-id="u4033b69e" id="u4033b69e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7023ca29" id="u7023ca29">采样：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u96c41e21" id="u96c41e21">以前面已经采样得到的块为条件，每次采样一个块。可以采用任意采样过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22W5tnd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSAMPLE%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7be93251" id="u7be93251">，从条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Xl702%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucab339c8" id="ucab339c8">中采样。其中，通过与预先计算的键和值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xxvoA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d3ec240" id="u7d3ec240">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CLoKq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a73d010" id="u4a73d010">执行交叉注意力，实现上下文条件化。与自回归模型类似，缓存键和值可以避免在采样新块时重新计算这些结果，从而节省计算。值得注意的是，块扩散解码算法能够采样生成任意长度的序列，而扩散模型通常受限于固定长度生成。此外，<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">块扩散采样器支持在每个块内部并行生成</span></strong>，而自回归采样器只能逐 token 生成</span></li></ul><figure class="paper-algorithm" id="block-diffusion-algorithm-1-figure" aria-labelledby="block-diffusion-algorithm-1"><figcaption id="block-diffusion-algorithm-1"><strong>Algorithm 1</strong> Block Diffusion Training</figcaption><div class="algorithm-body" id="block-diffusion-algorithms-30"><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number"></span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-30-line-0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7BInput%3A%7D%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdatapoint%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bnumber%20of%20blocks%20%7DB%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bforward%20noise%20process%20%7Dq_t(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%2C%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number"></span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-30-line-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7Bmodel%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bloss%20%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">1</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-30-line-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Brepeat%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">2</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-30-line-3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BSample%20%7Dt_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Ct_B%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BU%7D%5B0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">3</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-30-line-4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cforall%20b%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CB%5C%5C%7D%3A%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_b%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Csim%20q_%7Bt_b%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">4</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-30-line-5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad(%5C%5Cvarnothing%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3AB%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3AB%7D)%5C%5Cgets%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">5</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-30-line-6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cforall%20b%3A%5C%5C%20(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogit%7D%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cvarnothing%2C%5C%5Cvarnothing)%5C%5Cgets%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_b%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">6</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-30-line-7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogit%7D%7D%5C%5Cgets%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogit%7D%7D%5E%7B1%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Ccdots%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogit%7D%7D%5E%7BB%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">7</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-30-line-8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BTake%20gradient%20step%20on%20%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogit%7D%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">8</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-30-line-9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Buntil%20%7D%5C%5Ctext%7Bconverged%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div></div></figure><figure class="paper-algorithm" id="block-diffusion-algorithm-2-figure" aria-labelledby="block-diffusion-algorithm-2"><figcaption id="block-diffusion-algorithm-2"><strong>Algorithm 2</strong> Block Diffusion Sampling</figcaption><div class="algorithm-body" id="block-diffusion-algorithms-31"><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number"></span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-31-line-0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7BInput%3A%7D%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bnumber%20of%20blocks%20%7DB%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bmodel%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdiffusion%20sampling%20algorithm%20%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSAMPLE%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">1</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-31-line-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5C%5Cgets%5C%5Cvarnothing%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">2</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-31-line-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Db%3D1%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20to%20%7DB%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20do%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">3</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-31-line-3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cgets%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSAMPLE%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">4</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-31-line-4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad(%5C%5Cvarnothing%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%5C%5Cgets%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">5</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-31-line-5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cgets%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">6</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-31-line-6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cquad(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D)%5C%5Cgets(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">7</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-31-line-7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div><div class="algorithm-line"><span class="algorithm-line-number">8</span><span class="algorithm-line-body"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-algorithms-31-line-8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Breturn%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%7D"></card></span></div></div></figure><h2 data-lake-id="I7Z1c" id="I7Z1c"><span data-lake-id="u649c13d9" id="u649c13d9">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="u22db18ae" id="u22db18ae"> 𝐔𝐧𝐝𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐋𝐢𝐤𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐝 𝐆𝐚𝐩𝐬 𝐁𝐞𝐭𝐰𝐞𝐞𝐧 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 &amp; 𝐀𝐑 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u6168a14a" id="u6168a14a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud7f9bc69" id="ud7f9bc69">当前最有效的扩散语言模型通过掩蔽加噪，逐步将 token 替换为特殊掩码 token。本节介绍基于这一框架的掩蔽式块扩散模型 BD3-LMs</span></strong></p><ul list="ufe5e36d2"><li fid="u0a717134" data-lake-id="u08038958" id="u08038958"><span data-lake-id="ua05f383c" id="ua05f383c">更形式化地，对于位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22h8FY2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CL%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e4fe3f3" id="u0e4fe3f3">上的 token，采用逐 token 加噪过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uAj7k%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCat%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3B%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%2B(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u70dfe5c3" id="u70dfe5c3">，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22p54d8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u638752cc" id="u638752cc">是掩码 token 的独热编码，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22amrGW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5167bf9d" id="u5167bf9d">是关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wkDUL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u01ff5efe" id="u01ff5efe">严格递减的函数，且满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JYnTq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_0%3D1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud78c2b3d" id="ud78c2b3d">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ptNGz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_1%3D0%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u0a717134" data-lake-id="u0bb5d0e4" id="u0bb5d0e4"><span data-lake-id="u93cda0c2" id="u93cda0c2">在线性调度下， token 于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aTXP0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u98582ed8" id="u98582ed8">被掩蔽的概率为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zir3j%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221-%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63f2711f" id="u63f2711f">。采用 Sahoo et al.（2024a）、Shi et al.（2024）和 Ou et al.（2025）的简化目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1cd54c6e" id="u1cd54c6e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Zrcw1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3A%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BU%7D(0%2C1)%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf44aa0a1"><li fid="ubeb9ccf0" data-lake-id="u581017e1" id="u581017e1"><span data-lake-id="u8fbb19c0" id="u8fbb19c0">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hEtqu%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub4d2d640" id="ub4d2d640">表示将式（3）通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qxZwM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%5C%5Crightarrow%5C%5Cinfty%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucedb86b9" id="ucedb86b9">推广至连续时间后，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ONT27%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8ae9a0aa" id="u8ae9a0aa">的瞬时变化率。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eYcx5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%3D1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u042ad7bb" id="u042ad7bb">、采用 SUBS 约束且不显式输入时间步时，负证据下界是紧的；块较大时，尤其当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aSXeC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%5C%5Crightarrow%20L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e7fcb7a" id="u2e7fcb7a">时，通常仍存在变分间隙；<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">不同块大小对应不同模型，NELBO 形式不能保证跨模型严格单调性</span></strong></span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7096f678" id="u7096f678"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0d70eb1" id="uf0d70eb1">单 token 生成：在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wcFqs%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%3D1%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u47c9ddc2" id="u47c9ddc2">且<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">去噪网络不显式输入时间步、满足 SUBS 约束时</span></strong>，块扩散目标，即式（8），在期望意义上等价于自回归负对数似然，即式（1）。然而，当在 LM1B 数据集上分别训练块大小为 1 的块扩散模型和自回归模型时，发现二者之间仍存在两个困惑度点的差距</span></strong></p><ul list="u6f46ffa3"><li fid="uaf4486f3" data-lake-id="u944716fe" id="u944716fe"><span data-lake-id="u936e2ab5" id="u936e2ab5">尽管这两个目标在期望意义上等价，剩余的困惑度差距源于较高的训练方差。自回归模型使用全部</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yGzDC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u74e280b4" id="u74e280b4">个 token 的交叉熵进行训练，而块大小为 1 的块扩散模型仅对被掩蔽的 token 计算交叉熵，即满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22E07em%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7b7c72a6" id="u7b7c72a6">的 token，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fO4EY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CL%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua141e845" id="ua141e845">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HDyjw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BU%7D%5B0%2C1%5D%7Dq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%3D0.5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d6ff455" id="u1d6ff455">。因此，扩散训练中用于估计损失梯度的 token 减少一半，使其训练方差高于自回归模型</span></li><li fid="uaf4486f3" data-lake-id="ud5a25422" id="ud5a25422"><span data-lake-id="ud2c481fa" id="ud2c481fa">为消除似然差距，训练块大小为 1 的 BD3-LM 时，前向过程完全掩蔽 token，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22D5tDr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%3D1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7e89f4a" id="ub7e89f4a">，使扩散目标等价于自回归目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1da7a10a" id="u1da7a10a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue01d70ef" id="ue01d70ef">高方差训练与模型差距：基于单 token 生成实验，提出梯度方差估计量，用于降低块大小</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cwF9q%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%5C%5Cgeq1%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u28d2c727" id="u28d2c727">时扩散模型训练的方差</span></strong></p><ul list="uc1ed89a4"><li fid="ub5ddad84" data-lake-id="u439d231c" id="u439d231c"><span data-lake-id="u9a9d6f09" id="u9a9d6f09"><strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">NELBO 不依赖噪声调度</span></strong>，但训练使用的蒙特卡洛损失估计量不具备这种不变性，<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">其自身及梯度的方差均依赖噪声调度</span></strong></span></li><li fid="ub5ddad84" data-lake-id="u2dbb4d56" id="u2dbb4d56"><span data-lake-id="ub7fd1f50" id="ub7fd1f50">首先，给出批量大小为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rJ2vA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua25bdf45" id="ua25bdf45">时的 NELBO 估计量。将一批序列记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OlAOx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3D%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(K)%7D%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63caa2da" id="u63caa2da">，其中，各个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YVwSM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(k)%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa3e768c" id="ufa3e768c">独立同分布地采样自</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qm9Vn%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u554d5851" id="u554d5851">。由此得到如下批量 NELBO 估计量，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wMag3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t(k%2Cb)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uecd8a170" id="uecd8a170">表示为第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rpRom%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubadbaa82" id="ubadbaa82">条序列的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JUxZi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u58c78ee9" id="u58c78ee9">个块采样的时间步</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u64e55c4e" id="u64e55c4e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MfLw9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3A%3Dl(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BK%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5E%7BK%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt(k%2Cb)%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt(k%2Cb)%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(k)%2Cb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(k%2Cb)%7D%5E%7B(k)%2Cb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(k)%2C%3Cb%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uef478204"><li fid="u7513e6cc" data-lake-id="ue72ee852" id="ue72ee852"><span data-lake-id="u81a0d3a3" id="u81a0d3a3">对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nEQdV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9cd57f7" id="ua9cd57f7">个批次</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yY8KA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7Bm%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0111c69f" id="u0111c69f">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zU6pN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22m%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CM%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c245fe3" id="u3c245fe3">，梯度估计量的方差可估计为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf19574f0" id="uf19574f0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mN203%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BVar%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20l(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Capprox%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BM-1%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bm%3D1%7D%5E%7BM%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20l(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7Bm%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BM%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bm%3D1%7D%5E%7BM%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20l(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7Bm%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="YSmBn" id="YSmBn"><span data-lake-id="uef5e8051" id="uef5e8051">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u381c2ad6" id="u381c2ad6"> 𝐋𝐨𝐰-𝐕𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐍𝐨𝐢𝐬𝐞 𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐥𝐞𝐬 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐁𝐃𝟑-𝐋𝐌𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u15c234ab" id="u15c234ab"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9067d64d" id="u9067d64d">避免极端的掩蔽比例：目标是找到能够最小化梯度估计量方差的噪声调度，从而使训练尽可能高效。在掩蔽式建模中，希望随机掩蔽不同数量的 token，使模型学会消除不同程度的噪声，这对于采样过程至关重要</span></strong></p><ul list="u29ba5692"><li fid="ue835e5fc" data-lake-id="u6dcecf07" id="u6dcecf07"><span data-lake-id="u1cce8bce" id="u1cce8bce">如果仅掩蔽极少量 token，重建这些 token 就会非常容易，无法提供有价值的学习信号</span></li><li fid="ue835e5fc" data-lake-id="u03751937" id="u03751937"><span data-lake-id="uc37b00d2" id="uc37b00d2">如果将全部 token 掩蔽，最优的重建结果则是数据分布中各个 token 的边缘分布，这同样容易学习，也无法提供有价值的学习信号。这些极端的掩蔽比例会产生质量较差、方差较高的梯度。因此，希望通过一类简单而有效的新型调度，学习如何截除这些极端情况</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u242f27f1" id="u242f27f1"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua4d218ad" id="ua4d218ad">用于低方差梯度的截断调度：提出一类截断（clipped）噪声调度，从均匀分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22A0g8C%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221-%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BU%7D%5B%5C%5Cbeta%2C%5C%5Comega%5D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u020fe070" id="u020fe070">中采样掩蔽比例，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kmYJD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%220%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cbeta%3C%5C%5Comega%5C%5Cleq1%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4f5fd17b"><li fid="ua13b3753" data-lake-id="u553c3080" id="u553c3080"><span data-lake-id="u77056218" id="u77056218">训练时采样时间并映射至掩蔽比例区间：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22T2hyH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BU%7D(0%2C1)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a92a6d5" id="u9a92a6d5">，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NyyPX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221-%5C%5Calpha_t%3D%5C%5Cbeta%2B(%5C%5Comega-%5C%5Cbeta)t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf56b5e0a" id="uf56b5e0a">。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eBWDo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96fad96a" id="u96fad96a">随采样变量线性变化，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fdeM8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%3D%5C%5Cbeta-%5C%5Comega%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u90f8c2b2" id="u90f8c2b2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5965df3f" id="u5965df3f">面向不同块大小的数据驱动截断调度：由于最优掩蔽比例可能随块大小</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HhczB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u59eaf258" id="u59eaf258">而变化，在训练过程中自适应地学习噪声调度</span></strong></p><ul list="ua892775a"><li fid="u7f65229c" data-lake-id="ud4c65674" id="ud4c65674"><span data-lake-id="u4aee29b9" id="u4aee29b9">Kingma et al. 利用其平方形式的扩散损失，分离出方差项并对其进行最小化。然而，这一策略无法直接应用于式（10）中的方差估计量，因为不仅希望降低随机时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Fej5z%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uafca95cf" id="uafca95cf">带来的方差，还希望降低随机批次带来的方差</span></li><li fid="u7f65229c" data-lake-id="ud5e181a4" id="ud5e181a4"><span data-lake-id="ubaf01a8a" id="ubaf01a8a">因此，转而优化参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EiCSk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b4b6f54" id="u0b4b6f54">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RHhh0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88a82b46" id="u88a82b46">，以直接最小化训练方差。为限制这一优化过程的计算负担，<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">使用扩散 ELBO 估计量的方差，作为梯度估计量方差的代理指标</span></strong>，并据此优化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pFrCp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u919db210" id="u919db210">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wAKgK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc428fb43" id="uc428fb43">。在训练过程中定期进行网格搜索，以找到最优的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NKFtf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21ba81fb" id="u21ba81fb">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BpHFM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufb3c9322" id="ufb3c9322" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Jrl9u%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin_%7B0%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cbeta%3C%5C%5Comega%5C%5Cleq1%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BVar%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%2Ct%7D%5B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cbeta%2C%5C%5Comega)%5D%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u34fd9274"><li fid="u617e0399" data-lake-id="ub9b14634" id="ub9b14634"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a4ca51c" id="u7a4ca51c" style="color: #5C0036">扩散 NELBO 的方差与测试困惑度具有相关性。在一系列截断噪声比例分布下，发现，对于每个块大小</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zcNNv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B4%2C16%2C128%5C%5C%7D%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7c267c6f" id="u7c267c6f" style="color: #5C0036">，均存在一个唯一的分布，能够同时最小化 NELBO 的方差和测试困惑度</span></strong></li></ul><h2 id="proofs">🧮 Proofs</h2><!-- Translation of Appendix A and B.1–B.6, conference PDF pp. 17–21. Original equations (11)–(24) map to (A.1)–(A.14); the four attention-mask definitions map to (A.15)–(A.18). The source notation and derivation steps are retained. --><p id="diffusion-f74304-1"><strong>Block Diffusion 将数据分布<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-34%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card>中的序列<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-35%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B1%3AL%7D%3D%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5D%22%7D"></card>划分为<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-36%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22B%22%7D"></card>个长度为<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-37%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L'%22%7D"></card>的块，各块执行<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-38%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card>步离散扩散，负证据下界为</strong></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-2">令<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-41%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-42%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s%22%7D"></card>分别为<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-43%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t(i)%3Di%2FT%22%7D"></card>和<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-44%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s(i)%3D(i-1)%2FT%22%7D"></card>，其中<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-45%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%5C%5Cin%5B1%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-117%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5Cn%26%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(1)%3At(T)%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(1)%3At(T)%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(T)%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs(i)%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(i)%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7Dq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(i)%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs(i)%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5CBigl%5B%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%3D1%2FT%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brecons%7D%7D%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%2B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B2%2FT%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C(T-1)%2FT%2C1%5C%5C%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5C%2CT%5C%5C%2CD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdiffusion%7D%7D%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%2B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bprior%7D%7D%7D%5C%5CBigr%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.1%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p id="diffusion-f74304-3"><strong>掩码块扩散采用 Austin 等提出的掩码过程，通过扩散矩阵逐 token 加噪，再由前向概率计算逆向后验</strong></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-4">对状态<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-46%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CV%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card>定义扩散矩阵<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-47%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Q_t%22%7D"></card>。噪声调度<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-48%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card>随<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-49%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card>严格递减，满足<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-50%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_0%3D1%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-51%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_1%3D0%22%7D"></card>。以<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-52%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22m%3DV%22%7D"></card>为掩码索引，矩阵为</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-118%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5BQ_t%5D_%7Bij%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn1%2C%26i%3Dj%3Dm%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t%2C%26i%3Dj%5C%5Cneq%20m%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn1-%5C%5Calpha_t%2C%26j%3Dm%2C%5C%5C%20i%5C%5Cneq%20m%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.2%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-5">前向边缘分布对应的扩散矩阵<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-53%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Q_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%20s%7D%22%7D"></card>为下式，其中<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-54%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%20s%7D%3D%5C%5Calpha_t%2F%5C%5Calpha_s%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-119%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5BQ_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%20s%7D%5D_%7Bij%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn1%2C%26i%3Dj%3Dm%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%20s%7D%2C%26i%3Dj%5C%5Cneq%20m%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%20s%7D%2C%26j%3Dm%2C%5C%5C%20i%5C%5Cneq%20m%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.3%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-6">在 D3PM 框架下，前向加噪过程独立作用于每个 token<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-55%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CL%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card>，并通过扩散矩阵<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-56%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Q_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BV%5C%5Ctimes%20V%7D%22%7D"></card>定义为</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-120%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCat%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3B%5C%5Coverline%7BQ%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7BQ%7D_%7Bt(i)%7D%3DQ_%7Bt(1)%7DQ_%7Bt(2)%7D%5C%5Ccdots%20Q_%7Bt(i)%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.4%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-7">利用前向边缘分布的扩散矩阵，可以得到逆向后验<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-57%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%22%7D"></card>。其中，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-58%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Codot%22%7D"></card>表示两个向量的 Hadamard 积</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-121%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%7D%5Cn%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCat%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3B%5C%5Cfrac%7BQ_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%20s%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Codot%20Q_s%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%7D%7B(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7DQ_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Ctag%7BA.5%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p id="diffusion-f74304-8"><strong>SUBS 参数化<strong><span style="color: #DF2A3F">将掩码类别的预测概率设为零，并保留已经解掩码的 token</span></strong>，使掩码扩散的 NELBO 简化为交叉熵项的加权平均</strong></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-9">沿用 Sahoo、Shi 和 Ou 等的推导，简化式（A.1）的扩散损失<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-59%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdiffusion%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>。扩散状态仅有<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-60%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card>，SUBS 施加两项约束：干净序列不含掩码，令<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-61%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%3D0%22%7D"></card>；若<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-62%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cneq%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%22%7D"></card>，真实后验为<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-63%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cneq%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D)%3D1%22%7D"></card>，因此令<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-64%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cneq%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D)%3D1%22%7D"></card></li><li id="diffusion-f74304-10">由此，只需近似<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-65%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D)%22%7D"></card>。令<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-66%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%22%7D"></card>表示第<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-67%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card>个块中第<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-68%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%22%7D"></card>个位置的 token，扩散损失为</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-122%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdiffusion%7D%7D%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5C%2CT%5C%5Cleft%5BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C%21%5C%5Cleft%5Bq%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%29%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%29%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5C%2CT%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Csum_%7B%5C%5Cell%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%27%7DD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C%21%5C%5Cleft%5Bq%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%29%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%29%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5C%2CT%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Csum_%7B%5C%5Cell%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%27%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t-%5C%5Calpha_s%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%29%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5C%2CT%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t-%5C%5Calpha_s%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%29%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.6%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-11">上式中的<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-69%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>是第<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-70%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card>个块的离散时间扩散损失，第三步采用 Sahoo 等附录 B.1 的结果。令扩散步数<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-71%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%7D"></card>，以获得更紧的似然近似；此时原文使用<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-72%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T(%5C%5Calpha_t-%5C%5Calpha_s)%3D%5C%5Calpha'_t%22%7D"></card>，得到</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-123%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdiffusion%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha'_t%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.7%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-12">在连续时间情形下，Sahoo 等附录 A.2.4 表明，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-73%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(1)%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Clim_%7BT%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCat%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%3B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%3D1%2FT%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCat%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%3B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%22%7D"></card>，重建损失因此化为零</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-124%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brecons%7D%7D%20%3D-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(1)%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%20%3D-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(1)%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%20%3D0%20%5C%5Ctag%7BA.8%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-13">由于<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-75%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt%3D1%7D%3D0%22%7D"></card>，终点分布满足<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-76%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%29%3Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%29%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCat%7D%28%5C%5Ccdot%3B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%29%22%7D"></card>，故先验损失<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-74%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bprior%7D%7D%3D0%22%7D"></card>，目标简化为交叉熵的加权平均</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-125%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha'_t%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.9%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-14">上述 NELBO 不随噪声调度<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-78%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card>的选择而改变，相关推导见 Sahoo 等附录 E.1.1</li></ul><p id="diffusion-f74304-15"><strong>当块大小为<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-79%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L'%3D1%22%7D"></card>、块数为<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-80%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22B%3DL%22%7D"></card>时，每个块只生成一个 token，Block Diffusion 的 NELBO 恢复为自回归模型的负对数似然</strong></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-16">采用<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-81%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%3D1-t%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-82%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha'_t%3D-1%22%7D"></card>，再展开关于前向分布的期望，可得</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-10" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-126%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn-%5C%5Clog%20p%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%29%5Cn%26%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha%27_t%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%29%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bt%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%29%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bt%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%29%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bt%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%26q%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%29%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%29%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%2Bq%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%29%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%29%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.10%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-17">SUBS 参数化直接复制已解掩码的 token，故<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-83%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%3D0%22%7D"></card>。结合<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-84%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%3Dt%22%7D"></card>，式（A.10）化为</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-11" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-127%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5Cn%26%5C%5Cleq-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bt%7D%5C%5C%2Cq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D)%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.11%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p id="diffusion-f74304-18"><strong>NELBO 的紧性部分比较不同块大小下的目标，原文给出的结论为：对<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-85%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221%5C%5Cleq%20K%5C%5Cleq%20L%22%7D"></card>，有<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-86%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BK%7D%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BK%2B1%7D%22%7D"></card></strong></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-19">先考虑<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-87%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22K%3D1%22%7D"></card>，此时恢复自回归负对数似然。原文式（22）写为</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-12" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-128%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B1%7D%20%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha'_t%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%20%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%20%5C%5Ctag%7BA.12%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-20">当块大小为<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-88%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22K%3D2%22%7D"></card>时，原文式（23）为</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-13" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-129%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B2%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%2F2%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha'_t%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5C%5Ctag%7BA.13%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-21">原文先比较<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-89%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B1%7D%22%7D"></card>与<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-90%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B2%7D%22%7D"></card>，再通过归纳推广到所有<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-91%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221%5C%5Cleq%20K%5C%5Cleq%20L%22%7D"></card>。令<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-92%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%22%7D"></card>表示第<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-93%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card>个块中第<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-94%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cin%5B1%2CL'%5D%22%7D"></card>个位置的 token，原文式（24）为</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-14" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-130%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5Cn%26%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%2F2%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%2F2%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7B2%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%2F2%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7B2%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cleq-%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%2F2%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7B2%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%2C%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.14%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p id="diffusion-f74304-22"><strong>专门设计的注意力掩码将含噪序列与干净序列拼接，使 Transformer 在一次前向传播中同时建模全部块的条件概率<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-95%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%7D"></card></strong></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-23">对所有<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-96%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%5C%5Cin%5B1%2CB%5D%22%7D"></card>建模，需要同时处理含噪序列<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-97%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card>和条件上下文<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-98%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%7D"></card>。将两条序列拼接为<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-99%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfull%7D%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%7D"></card>并输入 Transformer，便可同时处理二者，无需调用去噪网络<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-100%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22B%22%7D"></card>次</li><li id="diffusion-f74304-24">拼接序列包含<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-101%22%2C%22code%22%3A%222L%22%7D"></card>个 token，采用自定义注意力掩码<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-102%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfull%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B0%2C1%5C%5C%7D%5E%7B2L%5C%5Ctimes2L%7D%22%7D"></card>更新其表示。完整掩码由四个<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-103%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5C%5Ctimes%20L%22%7D"></card>子矩阵构成</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-15" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-131%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfull%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D%26%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOBC%7D%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%26%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBC%7D%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.15%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-25"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-104%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>与<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-105%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOBC%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>用于更新<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-106%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%22%7D"></card>的表示，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-107%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBC%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>用于更新<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-108%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%7D"></card>的表示。块对角掩码<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-109%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>对应含噪块<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-110%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card>内的自注意力</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-16" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-132%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D%5D_%7Bij%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D1%2C%26i%2Cj%5C%5Ctext%7B%20belong%20to%20the%20same%20block%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C0%2C%26%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.16%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-26">偏移块因果掩码<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-111%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOBC%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>对应对条件上下文<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-112%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%7D"></card>的交叉注意力</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-17" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-133%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOBC%7D%7D%5D_%7Bij%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D1%2C%26j%5C%5Ctext%7B%20belongs%20to%20a%20block%20before%20%7Di%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C0%2C%26%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.17%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li id="diffusion-f74304-27">块因果掩码<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-113%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBC%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>用于更新<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-inline-114%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%7D"></card>，允许访问当前块及更早的块</li></ul><p id="block-diffusion-proofs-equation-A-18" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-proofs-134%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBC%7D%7D%5D_%7Bij%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D1%2C%26j%5C%5Ctext%7B%20belongs%20to%20the%20same%20block%20as%20%7Di%5C%5Ctext%7B%20or%20an%20earlier%20block%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C0%2C%26%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.18%7D%22%7D"></card></p><card type="block" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22block-diffusion-attention-code-32%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20torch%5Cndef%20block_diff_mask%28b%2C%20h%2C%20q_idx%2C%20kv_idx%2C%20block_size%2C%20n%29%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20x0_flag_q%20%3D%20%28q_idx%20%3E%3D%20n%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20x0_flag_kv%20%3D%20%28kv_idx%20%3E%3D%20n%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20block_q%20%3D%20torch.where%28%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20x0_flag_q%20%3D%3D%201%2C%20%28q_idx%20-%20n%29%20%2F%2F%20block_size%2C%20q_idx%20%2F%2F%20block_size%5Cn%20%20%20%20%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20block_kv%20%3D%20torch.where%28%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20x0_flag_kv%20%3D%3D%201%2C%20%28kv_idx%20-%20n%29%20%2F%2F%20block_size%2C%20kv_idx%20%2F%2F%20block_size%5Cn%20%20%20%20%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20block_diagonal%20%3D%20%28block_q%20%3D%3D%20block_kv%29%20%26%20%28x0_flag_q%20%3D%3D%20x0_flag_kv%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20offset_block_causal%20%3D%20%28%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%28block_q%20%3E%20block_kv%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%26%20%28x0_flag_q%20%3D%3D%200%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%26%20%28x0_flag_kv%20%3D%3D%201%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20block_causal%20%3D%20%28%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%28block_q%20%3E%3D%20block_kv%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%26%20%28x0_flag_q%20%3D%3D%201%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%26%20%28x0_flag_kv%20%3D%3D%201%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20block_diagonal%20%7C%20offset_block_causal%20%7C%20block_causal%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22Block%20Attention%20Mask%22%7D"></card>
